flowchart TD
    PWR([PLC上电]) --> BOOT[BOOT<br/>EtherCAT/NC/IO-Link/ADS基础检查]
    BOOT --> STOPPED[STOPPED]
    STOPPED --> MODE{硬件Mode+Source合法?}
    MODE -- 否 --> MF[Mode Conflict<br/>禁止Start]
    MODE -- Maintenance+Local --> MREADY[Maintenance Ready]
    MODE -- Manual+Local --> LREADY[Manual Ready]
    MODE -- Automatic+Robot --> AREADY[Automatic Ready]

    MREADY --> MCMD{HMI命令}
    MCMD -- Initialize --> INIT[INITIALIZING]
    MCMD -- Execute Maintenance --> MAINT[MAINTENANCE_ACTIVE]
    LREADY --> LCMD{HMI CommandId/Ack}
    LCMD -- Initialize --> INIT
    LCMD -- Start --> START
    AREADY --> RCMD{Robot Sequence/Ack}
    RCMD -- Initialize可配置 --> INIT
    RCMD -- Start+Point --> START

    INIT --> ICHK[轴/传感器/标定/Program/外围检查与回位]
    ICHK --> IOK{成功?}
    IOK -- 否 --> FAULT[FAULT]
    IOK -- 是 --> READY[READY]

    READY --> START[STARTING<br/>解析JoiningPoint/Program<br/>生成Cycle Snapshot]
    START --> PRE{PRECHECK}
    PRE -- 否 --> REJ[Reject/Fault]
    PRE -- 是 --> FASTENER[侦钉]
    FASTENER --> FS{无钉/单钉/多钉}
    FS -- 多钉 --> FAULT
    FS -- 无钉 --> FEED[弹夹/直吹送料]
    FEED --> FASTENER
    FS -- 单钉 --> APP[标准NC Approach]

    APP --> EXT[External预Feed+Enable]
    EXT --> CONTACT[低速Contact Search]
    CONTACT --> COK{ForceOn候选<br/>回差+去抖+位置窗口}
    COK -- 否/超时 --> CFAULT[Contact Fault/NOK]
    COK -- 是 --> CLATCH[锁存Contact<br/>SRelSensor=0<br/>PI无扰接管]

    CLATCH --> S1[STEP1<br/>RPM/Force/Z并行Ramp]
    S1 --> Q1[Primary/Secondary/StepMax<br/>EndCause]
    Q1 --> S2[STEP2 清理/激活]
    S2 --> Q2[Primary/Secondary/StepMax]
    Q2 --> S3[STEP3 焊接]
    S3 --> Q3[Primary/Secondary/StepMax]
    Q3 --> BR[BRAKE_AND_COMPRESSION_RAMP<br/>RPM→0 Force→Step4]
    BR --> H4[STEP4_VALID_FORCE_HOLD<br/>RpmStopped+ForceInBand计时]
    H4 --> UL[受控卸力<br/>Z速度归零]
    UL --> DIS[Direction握手+Disable External]
    DIS --> RET[标准NC Return]
    RET --> EVAL[Evaluate<br/>Force/Torque/Energy/Curve/EndCause]
    EVAL --> RESULT{OK/NOK/Fault}
    RESULT --> SAVE[保存WeldId/Point/Program/Result/Curve]
    SAVE --> READY

    subgraph FAST["Task_CffFast = NC SAF"]
        FI[Force Raw/Criterion/Control/Display]
        SI[SRelSensor主值<br/>SRelAxis诊断<br/>CollisionDelta]
        PI[导纳PI+Anti-windup+SRel制动]
        ET[External P/V/A/Direction]
        RR[R轴RPM/Torque/Power/Energy]
        PM[Criterion/Window/Observer/Curve]
        FI --> PI
        SI --> PI
        PI --> ET
        RR --> PM
    end

    Q1 -.-> FAST
    Q2 -.-> FAST
    Q3 -.-> FAST

    subgraph CMD["命令接口"]
        HMI[WPF CommandId/Ack<br/>Start/Stop/Init/Reset]
        ROB[Robot Sequence/Ack]
        DISP[PRG_CommandDispatcher]
        PULSE[PLC内部单扫描Pulse]
        HMI --> DISP
        ROB --> DISP
        DISP --> PULSE
    end

    subgraph CRIT["步骤准则"]
        RD[Primary=Relative Distance<br/>无Secondary]
        TM[Primary=Step Time<br/>Secondary累计S_rel]
        FD[Primary=Force Decline<br/>先Arm，PI继续跟随<br/>确认后切换<br/>Secondary累计S_rel]
    end

    Q1 -.-> CRIT
    Q2 -.-> CRIT
    Q3 -.-> CRIT

    READY -->|Stop| CSTOP[CONTROLLED_STOPPING]
    MAINT -->|Stop/Heartbeat失效| CSTOP
    S1 -->|Stop| CSTOP
    S2 -->|Stop| CSTOP
    S3 -->|Stop| CSTOP
    H4 -->|Stop| CSTOP
    CSTOP --> STOPPED

    FAULT -->|Reset且源消失| RESET[RESETTING]
    RESET --> STOPPED
